<span class="badge badge-warning">Incident Alert</span>
<h1>Critical Incident Registered</h1>
<p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
<p>A new IT service incident has been registered. Please inspect the incident report, verify system statuses, and allocate resources to minimize degradation of campus services.</p>

<div class="meta-box">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Incident ID:</td>
      <td class="meta-value"><strong>{{incidentNumber}}</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Subject:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{title}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Severity:</td>
      <td class="meta-value" style="color: #b45309;"><strong>{{severity}}</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Description:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{description}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p>You can review details and log response actions on the incident workspace by clicking below:</p>

{{button "Open Incident Log" actionUrl}}

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">Regards,<br/>CampusCare Service Policy Engine</p>
